00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.280
And as their friend...

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:30.040
I want to do everything I can for them.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.500
That's how prepared I am.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:39.500
So you have no plan for dividing 
your time between two clubs?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.540
I'll... make it work...

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.660
You leave me no choice.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.930
You will focus on the baseball 
club for the summer term.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:49.890
Huh?

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.930
Until the tournament is over, 
I'll take over the kendo club.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:58.270
I am a rank holder myself, after all.

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.590
Thank you so much!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.820
I hope Sensei is doing all right...

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:16.910
It's really being decided at 
today's staff meeting, right?

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:20.670
It should be, but it's hard 
to say what's going to happen.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:23.450
There might still be some obstacles.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:27.880
But if we aren't approved today,
the tournament...

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:31.380
It's okay. I just know it'll be okay.

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:38.860
Sensei!

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:40.820
How... did it go?

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:49.660
All right!

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:01.880
The Satogahama High School 
girls' baseball club...

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.070
will now begin its first practice!

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:06.340
Let's do this, girls!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:09.220
Let's do it!

